  "description": "Abel, the Demon King, suddenly appeared at the house of job-hunting student Kang Woo-ri! This great demon king has a knack for housework, and he'll do all kinds of household chores if you're willing to give your soul as payment. \n\n“Can I get a job?\"\nJust sell your soul!\nAll of your life's annoyances will be solved! \n\nBut the Great Demon King isn't the only one who suddenly appears... There is a \"ghost\" that pops up anywhere at any time! And there's that ex-boyfriend Hyunseong who broke up a few years ago? An urban fantasy romance that's often slapstick, usually playful, and sometimes even serious! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
